flowchart LR
    SOURCES["Git source manifests<br/>openshift/spo/*.yaml"]
    BUNDLE_RENDER["AAP policy job renders<br/>blastwall-spo-crs.yaml"]
    ARTIFACT["Workflow job artifact store<br/>Job JSON .artifacts"]
    APPLY["AAP apply/validate node<br/>or operator change window"]
    LIVE["OpenShift objects<br/>RawSelinuxProfile + SCC"]
    PROOF["UBI validation jobs<br/>standard + nested passed"]

    SOURCES -->|checked out from project<br/>and versioned policy inputs| BUNDLE_RENDER
    BUNDLE_RENDER -->|emitted as job artifact| ARTIFACT
    ARTIFACT -->|downloaded from job JSON| APPLY
    APPLY --> LIVE
    LIVE --> PROOF
